{{#is_alert}}
## 🚨 CRITICAL INCIDENT: Smart Contract Paused

**Contract**: {{contract.name}}
**Environment**: {{environment.name}}
**Current Value**: {{value}}

The Soroban smart contract has entered an emergency paused state. All write operations (minting, transfers, listings, purchases) are currently blocked.

### Required Action:
1. Verify if this was an authorized administrative action via the audit log.
2. Review the incident runbook: [Emergency Pause Runbook](https://github.com/Carbon-Ledger-stellar/carbonledger/blob/main/docs/runbooks/emergency-pause.md)
3. Check reason logs in Loki/Datadog using query `event:contract_pause`.
4. Escalate to the On-Call Security Lead immediately.

@pagerduty-security @slack-incident-alerts
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_recovery}}
## ✅ RESOLVED: Smart Contract Resumed

Smart contract {{contract.name}} has been unpaused. Operations have returned to normal.

@slack-incident-alerts
{{/is_recovery}}

{{#is_alert}}
## ⚠️ WARNING: Smart Contract Pause Window Expiring Soon

Contract {{contract.name}} emergency pause window has less than **1 hour remaining** ({{value}} seconds left).

If the incident investigation is still ongoing, an administrator must extend the pause deadline or prepare the contract for operational resumption.

@slack-devops-alerts
{{/is_alert}}
